 Berserker's Fury\",\"text\":\"Purchase Berserker's Fury (2,390 gold) as item 2 in the Anti-Dive Cleanse build for Layla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla#build-anti-dive-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Windtalker\",\"text\":\"Purchase Windtalker (1,880 gold) as item 3 in the Anti-Dive Cleanse build for Layla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla#build-anti-dive-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Haas's Claws\",\"text\":\"Purchase Haas's Claws (2,020 gold) as item 4 in the Anti-Dive Cleanse build for Layla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla#build-anti-dive-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Wind of Nature\",\"text\":\"Purchase Wind of Nature (1,910 gold) as item 5 in the Anti-Dive Cleanse build for Layla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla#build-anti-dive-cleanse\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Anti-Dive Cleanse build for Layla.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla#build-anti-dive-cleanse\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/layla\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}60:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":18,\"name\":\"Layla\",\"slug\":\"layla\",\"title\":\"Energy Gunner\",\"role\":[\"Marksman\"],\"specialty\":[\"Finisher\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Gold\"],\"tier\":\"B\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2016,\"stats\":{\"durability\":10,\"offense\":80,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":20},\"winRate\":49.51,\"pickRate\":1.86,\"banRate\":1.4,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Layla's relatively longer attack range lets her counter slow Tanks like Tigreal and Belerick.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Layla's relatively longer attack range lets her counter slow Tanks like Tigreal and Belerick.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Layla is countered by Assassins with high burst damage, such as Karina and Ling, as they can get the jump on Layla and melt her easily.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"ling\",\"heroName\":\"Ling\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Layla is countered by Assassins with high burst damage, such as Karina and Ling, as they can get the jump on Layla and melt her easily.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_0db5131842bec1fdbdf5f8533ebada2c.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b2b38e9406ea0de0b866db7674feea0f.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"10\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_07605801972ede9147e9769ac7991aa0.png\",\"tip\":\"Franco should be the one hooking through their foes, pushing their foes into them while the Layla will try to attack it.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"26\",\"heroName\":\"Chou\",\"heroSlug\":\"chou\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a3dd4a2b8bd5b8f25a8dd520f2c1c71a.png\",\"tip\":\"With Layla's Malefic Gun and her Void Projectile, she can easily slow down Chou and track him down. Layla is like a hunter whenever she wants to hunt Chou down.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"15\",\"heroName\":\"Eudora\",\"heroSlug\":\"eudora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_ed32e3c71ecd41652fc54a7efd02aba4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Eudora can deal massive damages against the Marksman, especially to Layla.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Malefic Gun\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Layla deals increased damage to targets farther away from her (starting at 100% and increasing to 115% at 6 units away). This does not apply to Turrets.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Layla deals increased damage to targets farther away from her (starting at 100% and increasing to 115% at 6 units away). This does not apply to Turrets.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ba25b082b2a373138d398a32499e0544.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Malefic Bomb\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Layla fires a Malefic Bomb in the target direction, dealing 200 (+80% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the first enemy hit (can Crit).\\n\\nUpon hitting an enemy, Layla's Basic Attacks and Void Projectile gain extra range for 3s, and she gains 60% extra Movement Speed that decays over 1.2s. The duration of the Movement Speed boost is doubled if an enemy hero is hit.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Layla fires a Malefic Bomb in the target direction, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+80% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the first enemy hit (can Crit).\\n\\nUpon hitting an enemy, Layla's Basic Attacks and \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Void Projectile\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" gain extra range for 3s, and she gains 60% extra Movement Speed that decays over 1.2s. The duration of the Movement Speed boost is doubled if an enemy hero is hit.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"6s\",\"manaCost\":\"35\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b00ff9edafd44eeee4af815f24c14653.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Void Projectile\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Layla fires an orb of Malefic Energy at the target, dealing 170 (+65% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby enemies and applying a Magic Mark to the target for 3s.\\nWhen Layla hits an enemy with a Magic Mark, she deals 100 (+35% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to the target and nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.25s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Layla fires an orb of Malefic Energy at the target, dealing 170\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+65% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target and nearby enemies and applying a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target for 3s.\\nWhen Layla hits an enemy with a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Magic Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\", she deals 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+35% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the target and nearby enemies, stunning them for 0.25s.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7.5s\",\"manaCost\":\"70\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_03f3b37b699108735c77c0197acac646.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Destruction Rush\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Passive: The range of Void Projectile and Basic Attacks is increased by 0.6 units. Layla's sight range is slightly increased each time this skill is upgraded.\\nActive: Layla fires a blast of Malefic Energy in the target direction, dealing 500 (+150% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in a line.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Passive\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": The range of \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Void Projectile\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" and Basic Attacks is increased by 0.6 units. Layla's sight range is slightly increased each time this skill is upgraded. \\n\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Active\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\": Layla fires a blast of Malefic Energy in the target direction, dealing 500\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+150% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies in a line.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"37s\",\"manaCost\":\"130\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8410070e72f25785078a91c793a39cc0.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Buff\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Layla's basic attack damage deals huge damage upon her foes. Increasing her attack speed greatly can make her become more unstoppable.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Layla's basic attack damage deals huge damage upon her foes. Increasing her attack speed greatly can make her become more unstoppable.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Layla works best with Tanks that can protect backline heroes, such as Minsitthar and Belerick, since their protection gives Layla more opportunities to deal damage.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"belerick\",\"heroName\":\"Belerick\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Layla works best with Tanks that can protect backline heroes, such as Minsitthar and Belerick, since their protection gives Layla more opportunities to deal damage.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, first use Layla's 1st Skill to increase the range of her 2nd Skill. With the extra range, she can easily apply marks to enemies. Use her Ultimate to detonate them all for a hefty bit of damage, and finish off with Basic Attacks.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b00ff9edafd44eeee4af815f24c14653.png\"},{\"skillId\":1820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_03f3b37b699108735c77c0197acac646.png\"},{\"skillId\":1830,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8410070e72f25785078a91c793a39cc0.png\"},{\"skillId\":1800,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, first use Layla's 2nd Skill to apply Magic Mark on the enemy, then detonate it with her 1st Skill for AOE damage while getting extra range for Basic Attacks to further harass the enemy from afar.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":1820,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_03f3b37b699108735c77c0197acac646.png\"},{\"skillId\":1810,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_b00ff9edafd44eeee4af815f24c14653.png\"},{\"skillId\":1800,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Layla build, counter, and emblem guide for Mobile Legends. Learn her crit spike, range-first teamfights, flex items, and the drafts that keep her alive.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Layla is a gold-lane siege cannon, not a mercy pick for drafts that already look fragile. She wins when your team can keep one layer of peel in front of her, the fight stays front-to-back, and the enemy has to walk through vision just to touch her.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"layla\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"gold-crit-range\",\"name\":\"Gold Lane Crit Range\",\"roleContext\":\"Gold\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"swift-boots\",\"name\":\"Swift Boots\",\"cost\":710,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\",\"cost\":2390,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\",\"cost\":1880,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"great-dragon-spear\",\"name\":\"Great Dragon Spear\",\"cost\":2140,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"haass-claws\",\"name\":\"Haas's Claws\",\"cost\":2020,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"berserkers-fury\",\"name\":\"Berserker's Fury\"},{\"slug\":\"windtalker\",\"name\":\"Windtalker\"},{\"slug\":\"great-dragon-spear\",\"name\":\"Great Dragon Spear\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"marksman\",\"name\":\"Marksman Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"fatal\",\"name\":\"Fatal\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/fatal.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"weapon-master\",\"name\":\"Weapon Master\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/weapon-master.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"quantum-charge\",\"name\":\"Quantum Charge\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/quantum-charge.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":null,\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy front line stacks Physical Defense and your team can already protect your first position.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"wind-of-nature\",\"name\":\"Wind of Nature\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against physical assassins or marksmen who can reach you before Flicker creates enough distance.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"sea-halberd\",\"name\":\"Sea Halberd\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP fighters keep the first target alive through your crit window.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default gold lane setup that turns Layla's range upgrades into crit pressure while keeping Flicker and one shield slot for repositioning.\",\"totalCost\":10960,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":200,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Great Dragon Spear\",\"Haas's Claws\",\"Rose Gold Meteor\"]},{\"key\":\"critchance\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalChance\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":85,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\",\"Windtalker\",\"Great Dragon Spear\",\"Haas's Claws\"]},{\"key\":\"critdmg\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.criticalDamage\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Berserker's Fury\"]},{\"key\":\"attackspeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.attackSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":85,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Windtalker\",\"Haas's Claws\",\"Rose Gold Meteor\"]},{\"key\":\"lifesteal\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.lifesteal\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":30,\"sources\":[\"Haas's Claws\",\"Rose Gold Meteor\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Swift Boots\",\"Windtalker\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Great Dragon Spear\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=layla\u0026items=swift